nd damaging enemy units along its line.", "notes_zh": ["小兵将会等待沟壑消失，不会去尝试绕开它。", "沟壑不会被林肯法球抵挡。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "降低沟壑的冷却时间，并且撼地者每次施放其他技能时都会沿着沟壑释放余震，造成眩晕的时间有所降低。", "en": "Reduces Fissure cooldown and releases an Aftershock along its path that stuns for a shortened duration when Earthshaker casts another ability."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["fissure_duration", "fissure_radius", "stun_duration", "fissure_damage", "shard_aftershock_stun_duration_pct", "free_pathing_linger_duration", "fissure_max_distance_moved", "echoes_radius", "echoes_damage_multiplier", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "earthshaker_enchant_totem", "name_zh": "撼地者·强化图腾", "name_en": "Enchant Totem", "description_zh": "强化撼地者的图腾，使下次攻击拥有额外攻击力和%bonus_attack_range%攻击距离加成。", "description_en": "Empowers Earthshaker's totem, causing it to deal extra damage and have %bonus_attack_range% bonus attack range on the next attack.", "notes_zh": ["攻击力加成是基于基础攻击力和主属性数值。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "强化图腾可以对地施放，施放后会跳至半空中再降落至目标地点，在目标地点施放强化图腾。双击技能会按原技能施放，不会跳跃。强化图腾拥有分裂效果。", "en": "Enchant Totem becomes a ground target ability, causing Earthshaker to jump in the air and land at the target spot, casting Enchant Totem there.  Self-casting the ability will behave in the original form, without jumping. Grants Enchant Totem a cleaving attack."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["totem_damage_percentage", "distance_scepter", "scepter_height", "scepter_height_arcbuffer", "scepter_acceleration_z", "scepter_acceleration_horizontal", "scepter_leap_duration", "scepter_cleave_pct", "scepter_cleave_starting_width", "scepter_cleave_ending_width", "scepter_cleave_distance", "bonus_attack_range", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "cleave", "condition": "scepter"}]}, {"subject": "earthshaker_aftershock", "name_zh": "撼地者·余震", "name_en": "Aftershock", "description_zh": "撼地者施放技能时会引起脚下的大地震动，眩晕附近的敌方单位并造成额外伤害。", "description_en": "Causes the earth to shake underfoot, adding additional damage and stuns to nearby enemy units when Earthshaker casts his abilities.", "notes_zh": ["使用物品不会触发余震。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["aftershock_range", "aftershock_damage", "AbilityDuration"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "earthshaker_echo_slam", "name_zh": "撼地者·回音击", "name_en": "Echo Slam", "description_zh": "穿过地面的冲击波，伤害敌方单位。每个受到攻击的敌人都会引起伤害附近单位的反射波。英雄本体将引起两次反射。", "description_en": "Shockwaves travel through the ground, damaging enemy units.  Each enemy hit causes an echo to damage nearby units. Real heroes cause two echoes.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["echo_slam_damage_range", "echo_slam_echo_search_range", "echo_slam_echo_range", "echo_slam_echo_damage", "echo_slam_initial_damage", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "earthshaker_slugger", "name_zh": "撼地者·强击图腾", "name_en": "Slugger", "description_zh": "利用强化图腾的攻击或撼地者的其他技能击杀敌人后都会把尸体击飞，对击中的敌人造成伤害。", "description_en": "Enemies killed with Enchant Totem or Earthshaker's other abilities are sent flying, dealing damage to enemies they hit.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["projectile_body_on_kill", "projectile_body_initial_impact_radius", "projectile_body_speed", "projectile_body_distance", "projectile_body_width_creep", "projectile_body_width_hero", "projectile_body_vision", "projectile_body_damage_creep", "projectile_body_damage_hero", "projectile_body_damage_additional_percent_health"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "juggernaut_blade_fury", "name_zh": "主宰·剑刃风暴", "name_en": "Blade Fury", "description_zh": "舞起具有破坏性力量的剑刃风暴，使主宰获得减益免疫状态，魔法抗性提升%immunity_resist%%%，并且每%blade_fury_damage_tick%秒对主宰周围的敌方单位造成伤害。旋转结束时施加强驱散效果。", "description_en": "Causes a bladestorm of destructive force around Juggernaut, rendering him debuff immune with %immunity_resist%%% magic resistance and dealing damage every %blade_fury_damage_tick%s to nearby enemy units. Applies a strong dispel at the end of the spin.", "notes_zh": ["剑刃风暴期间可以使用物品。", "主宰在施放剑刃风暴的过程中依然可以进行物理攻击。但是只有不受剑刃风暴伤害的单位，如守卫和建筑才会受到这些物理伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["blade_fury_damage", "blade_fury_damage_tick", "blade_fury_radius", "duration", "bonus_movespeed", "immunity_resist", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "juggernaut_healing_ward", "name_zh": "主宰·治疗守卫", "name_en": "Healing Ward", "description_zh": "召唤一个治疗守卫，按周围友军单位最大生命值的一定比例治疗他们。治疗守卫可以移动，移动速度为%healing_ward_movespeed_tooltip%。持续%abilityduration%秒。", "description_en": "Summons a Healing Ward which heals all nearby allied units, based on their max health.  The Healing Ward moves at %healing_ward_movespeed_tooltip% movement speed after being summoned.  Lasts %abilityduration% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["可以控制治疗守卫。", "多个治疗守卫的效果不会叠加。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "提升守卫的治疗量和生命值。", "en": "Increases ward healing and health."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["healing_ward_heal_amount", "healing_ward_aura_radius", "healing_ward_movespeed_tooltip", "healing_ward_bonus_health", "healing_ward_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "juggernaut_blade_dance", "name_zh": "主宰·剑舞", "name_en": "Blade Dance", "description_zh": "主宰有一定概率在攻击时触发致命一击。", "description_en": "Gives Juggernaut a chance to deal critical damage with Blade Fury and on each attack.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["blade_dance_crit_chance", "blade_dance_crit_mult", "blade_dance_lifesteal"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "critical", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "juggernaut_omni_slash", "name_zh": "主宰·无敌斩", "name_en": "Omnislash", "description_zh": "主宰挥剑跃向敌方目标单位，随后再以更短的攻击频率斩击该单位和附近的其它敌方单位。主宰在无敌斩期间无敌。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Juggernaut leaps towards the target enemy units, and then slashes the target and other nearby enemy units at an increased attack rate. Juggernaut is invulnerable for the duration.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["无敌斩期间可以使用物品。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["attack_rate_multiplier", "bonus_damage", "bonus_attack_speed", "duration", "omni_slash_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_starfall", "name_zh": "米拉娜·群星风暴", "name_en": "Starstorm", "description_zh": "召唤一波流星砸向附近的敌方单位。%starfall_secondary_radius%范围内最近的敌方单位将会再受到一次冲击。", "description_en": "Calls down a wave of meteors to damage nearby enemy units. The closest enemy unit to Mirana in a %starfall_secondary_radius% radius will be struck a second time.", "notes_zh": ["群星风暴不会被林肯法球抵挡。", "群星风暴不能伤害隐身单位。", "如果原本要打击的目标死亡，群星风暴的第二次星落会重新选择一个目标。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "secondary_starfall_damage_percent", "starfall_radius", "starfall_secondary_radius", "secondary_targets", "starstruck_blind_pct", "starstruck_duration", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "summons", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_arrow", "name_zh": "米拉娜·月神之箭", "name_en": "Sacred Arrow", "description_zh": "射出一支绝对精准的箭矢，对第一个击中的敌人造成伤害并眩晕目标。目标距离越远，眩晕时间越长，最短%arrow_min_stun%秒，最长可达%arrow_max_stun%秒。根据箭矢飞行的距离还将对目标额外造成最多%arrow_bonus_damage%点伤害。若击中的是非远古的普通单位，将直接秒杀。", "description_en": "Fires a long-range arrow with deadly precision, which stuns and damages the first enemy unit it strikes. The stun duration ranges from %arrow_min_stun% to %arrow_max_stun% seconds, with bonus damage up to %arrow_bonus_damage% added, based on the distance the arrow travels to its target. Instantly kills the first non-ancient creep it hits.", "notes_zh": ["神箭每飞行150码，中箭后眩晕的持续时间将提高0.5秒，额外伤害增加14点。", "月神之箭可以射中隐身单位。", "流星赶月不会对阿哈利姆神杖升级群星风暴的第二次流星生效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "月神之箭在主神箭行进途中对敌人释放群星风暴。对击中的单位施放第二个群星风暴，造成的伤害有所降低。", "en": "Causes Sacred Arrow to release a Starstorm on enemies along the travel path of the primary arrow, releasing a second Starstorm that deals less damage to the impacted unit."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["arrow_speed", "arrow_width", "arrow_range", "arrow_max_stunrange", "arrow_min_stun", "arrow_max_stun", "arrow_bonus_damage", "arrow_vision", "scepter_radius", "scepter_starstorm_target_pct", "extra_arrows", "extra_arrows_angle", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "execute", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "invisibility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_leap", "name_zh": "米拉娜·跳跃", "name_en": "Leap", "description_zh": "米拉娜的坐骑向前跳跃加入战斗，发出一声凶狠的咆哮鼓舞它的主人，提升攻击和移动速度。速度加成持续%leap_bonus_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Mirana leaps forward into battle, empowering herself with a ferocious roar that grants bonus attack and movement speed. Speed bonus lasts %leap_bonus_duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "获得+%additional_charges%跳跃能量点数。", "en": "Grants +%additional_charges% Leap charge."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["leap_distance", "leap_speed", "leap_acceleration", "leap_speedbonus", "leap_speedbonus_as", "leap_bonus_duration", "additional_charges", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_celestial_quiver", "name_zh": "米拉娜·天界箭袋", "name_en": "Celestial Quiver", "description_zh": "有可用能量时，米拉娜的下次攻击会造成额外魔法伤害。", "description_en": "When a charge is available, Mirana's next attack will deal bonus magic damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "跳跃的加成状态生效时获得%quiver_restore%点临时能量。", "en": "Grants %quiver_restore% temporary Charges while Leap's buff is active."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_damage", "quiver_restore", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "charges", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "mirana_invis", "name_zh": "米拉娜·月之暗面", "name_en": "Moonlight Shadow", "description_zh": "让米拉娜和所有己方英雄进入隐身状态。米拉娜在持续时间内获得伤害输出加成。只要还在月光阴影的持续时间内，即使隐身被打破也会在短时间内重新淡入隐身。", "description_en": "Turns Mirana and all allied heroes invisible and grants bonus movement speed. Mirana gains bonus outgoing damage during the duration. If a hero is revealed, invisibility will restore after the fade delay as long as Moonlight Shadow's duration has not expired.", "notes_zh": ["受到作用的单位会自动停止攻击敌人。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["fade_delay", "duration", "bonus_movement_speed", "evasion", "bonus_outgoing_damage_pct", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "invisibility", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "reveal", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_shadowraze1", "name_zh": "影魔·毁灭阴影", "name_en": "Shadowraze", "description_zh": "影魔对其正前方区域释放毁灭能量，对该区域中的敌人造成伤害，并且根据当前支配死灵的灵魂数量造成额外伤害。在目标身上施加一个连中效果，持续时间内再被毁灭阴影击中将受到额外伤害。", "description_en": "Shadow Fiend razes the ground directly in front of him, dealing damage to enemy units in the area, dealing bonus damage based on his current Necromastery Soul amount. Adds a stacking damage amplifier on the target that causes the enemy to take bonus Shadowraze damage per stack.", "notes_zh": ["连中效果的持续时间在每次连中时刷新。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "每击中一名敌方英雄后冷却时间减少%cooldown_reduction_on_hero_hit%秒。对击中的敌人施加可叠加的%movement_speed_debuff%%%移动速度减缓的负面效果。", "en": "Cooldown reduced by %cooldown_reduction_on_hero_hit%s per enemy hero hit. Applies a stacking %movement_speed_debuff%%% movement speed debuff on enemies hit."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["shadowraze_damage", "shadowraze_radius", "shadowraze_range", "shadowraze_cooldown", "stack_bonus_damage", "duration", "procs_attack", "movement_speed_debuff", "cooldown_reduction_on_hero_hit", "damage_per_soul", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_dark_lord", "name_zh": "影魔·魔王降临", "name_en": "Presence of the Dark Lord", "description_zh": "影魔的出现使得周围的敌人护甲降低。", "description_en": "Shadow Fiend's presence reduces the armor of nearby enemies.", "notes_zh": ["与其他降低护甲的技能和光环完全叠加。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["presence_armor_reduction", "presence_radius", "AbilityCastRange"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "armor_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "aura", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_requiem", "name_zh": "影魔·魂之挽歌", "name_en": "Requiem of Souls", "description_zh": "影魔将捕获的灵魂中最多%max_soul_release%个进行聚集，以多道魔能的形式释放。若距离影魔过近将受到数道魔能的伤害。每道魔能对敌方单位造成伤害的同时，还将造成恐惧和减速效果，并且降低魔法抗性，持续%requiem_slow_duration%秒，最高可达%requiem_slow_duration_max%秒。通过支配死灵收集的每个灵魂会为魂之挽歌创造一道魔能。死亡时会自动释放魂之挽歌，不占用主动大招的冷却时间。", "description_en": "Shadow Fiend gathers up to %max_soul_release% of his captured souls to release them as lines of demonic energy. Units near Shadow Fiend when the souls are released can be damaged by several lines of energy. Any unit damaged by Requiem of Souls will be feared and have its movement speed and magic resistance reduced for %requiem_slow_duration% seconds for each line hit up to a maximum of %requiem_slow_duration_max%. Lines of energy are created for every soul captured through Necromastery.  Requiem of Souls is automatically cast whenever Shadow Fiend dies, regardless of its cooldown.", "notes_zh": ["影魔收集的灵魂中，每%requiem_soul_conversion%个会产生一道伤害波。", "死亡时释放的魂之挽歌不会施加恐惧和减速效果。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "降低冷却时间，并且魂之挽歌可以回归影魔。影魔会回复与回归伤害值相等的生命。", "en": "Reduces cooldown and causes Requiem of Souls to return back to Shadow Fiend. The wave back to Shadow Fiend heals him for all the damage it dealt."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["requiem_radius", "requiem_reduction_ms", "requiem_reduction_mres", "requiem_slow_duration", "requiem_slow_duration_max", "requiem_soul_conversion", "requiem_line_width_start", "requiem_line_width_end", "requiem_line_speed", "soul_death_release", "requiem_heal_pct_scepter", "requiem_damage_pct_scepter", "max_soul_release", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityCastPoint"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "forced_action", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "nevermore_necromastery", "name_zh": "影魔·支配死灵", "name_en": "Necromastery", "description_zh": "影魔每杀死一个单位都会窃取其灵魂，每个灵魂获得%necromastery_damage_per_soul%点额外攻击力。击杀英雄会获得%souls_per_hero_kill%个灵魂。影魔死亡时%soul_release_tooltip%%%的灵魂将逃离他的束缚。", "description_en": "Shadow Fiend steals the soul from units he kills, gaining %necromastery_damage_per_soul% bonus damage per soul. Hero kills grant %souls_per_hero_kill% souls. On death, he releases %soul_release_tooltip%%% of them from bondage.", "notes_zh": ["反补、杀死中立生物也能收集到灵魂。", "破坏会使技能无法获得新的叠加效果。", "破坏不会使现有叠加效果提供的加成失效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["necromastery_damage_per_soul", "necromastery_max_souls", "souls_per_kill", "souls_per_hero_kill", "necromastery_soul_release", "shard_souls_per_kill", "shard_crit_pct", "shard_fear_duration", "soul_release_tooltip", "current_max_souls_tooltip"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "mobility_lock", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "morphling_waveform", "name_zh": "变体精灵·波浪形态", "name_en": "Waveform", "description_zh": "变体精灵化为波浪向前涌进，对路径上的敌人造成伤害。变体精灵在波浪形态中是无敌的。", "description_en": "Morphling dissolves into liquid and surges forward, damaging enemy units in his path. Morphling is invulnerable during Waveform.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "width", "process_procs", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "morphling_adaptive_strike_agi", "name_zh": "变体精灵·变体打击", "name_en": "Adaptive Strike", "description_zh": "用猛烈的水波打击一个敌方单位，将其击退并眩晕，同时造成伤害，伤害量为基础伤害加上变体精灵自身敏捷值乘以伤害系数的额外伤害。如果变体精灵的敏捷比力量高50%%，将采用最高伤害系数。\n\n击退距离和眩晕时间是根据变体精灵的力量值。如果变体精灵的力量比敏捷高50%%，将造成最大击退和眩晕。", "description_en": "Launches a surge of water toward an enemy unit, stunning them, knocking them back, and dealing base damage plus additional damage based on Morphling's agility times a multiplier.  If Morphling's agility is 50% higher than strength, the maximum agility multiplier is used.\n\nKnockback distance and stun duration are based on Morphling's strength. If his strength is 50% higher than his agility, the maximum knockback distance and stun duration is used.", "notes_zh": ["弹道移动速度为%projectile_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_base", "damage_min", "damage_max", "stun_min", "stun_max", "knockback_min", "knockback_max", "knockback_duration", "projectile_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "stun", "condition": "base"}]}]}
